(text "Crystal circuit per design guide Sec 4. Y1 IS TAXM12M4RFBCCT2T (LCSC C133337), 12 MHz, SMD 3225 4-pad, CL = 12 pF - the\nABM8-272-T3 the earlier revision named is not orderable at JLCPCB in any form (reports/jlc-audit.md section 1).\nLOAD CAPS FOLLOW THE CRYSTAL, NOT THE OTHER WAY ROUND: CL = C46*C47/(C46+C47) + Cstray, so C46/C47 are 18 pF C0G each\n(2 x 18 pF in series = 9 pF, plus ~3 pF of XIN/XTAL_DRV pin and trace stray = 12 pF, matching CL exactly). They were\n15 pF against the old CL 10 pF part; leaving 15 pF on a CL 12 pF crystal gives 10.5 pF of load, i.e. an under-loaded\noscillator running fast by roughly the trim sensitivity of the part. The ~3 pF stray is the design-guide estimate and is\nthe one term here that is not a datasheet number - if the board is ever pulled for frequency, that is the term to measure.\n1 k in the XOUT leg to limit drive with a 50 ohm ESR crystal. C38 is the single design-guide decoupling exception (pins 68+69 share it).\nVREG_AVDD RC = 33 ohm + 4.7 uF (design guide Sec 2.1), taken from V3V3_SYS; VREG_FB is tied to DVDD, VREG_PGND to GND, EP to GND." (at 15 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid d2252058-6557-516a-902d-f6cab246e501))
(text "PORT NAMING: a port label is named for the peripheral pin it comes from, so GPS_TX / ELRS_TX are module outputs\nand land on MCU UART RX pins, while GPS_RX / ELRS_RX are module inputs fed by the MCU UART TX pins. On the IO\narray (POWER 3) the UART rows are therefore 1 GPS_RX (silk T0) / 2 GPS_TX (R0) / 3 ELRS_RX (T1) / 4 ELRS_TX (R1),\nrows 5/6 are MAG_SDA / MAG_SCL, rows 7-10 the PWM5-8 servo signals and rows 11-14 the four exposed spares.\nThe array is three stacked 1x14 rows: J6 SIGNAL, J7 POWER, J8 GND. All array SIGNAL pins are 3.3 V CMOS.\nGPIO37 (pin 46) is no longer spare: it reads PWR_SRC_ST, the open-drain ST output of U25 (TPS2121), which is\nhigh while 5V_IN (IN1) powers V5_SYS and low while USB VBUS (IN2) does." (at 155 233 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 51f74c45-0cfc-5040-b90c-b0eb6f6800b6))
(text "GPIO MAP (pin = QFN-80 pin)\nGPIO0    77  FLASH_CS1    QMI CS1n, log flash select\nGPIO1    78  HG_ACC_INT   ADXL375 INT1\nGPIO2    79  IMU_INT2     ICM-45686 INT2/FSYNC/CLKIN\nGPIO3    80  LED_DATA     WS2812C-2020 data, 100 R series (R55)\nGPIO4     1  HG_ACC_CS    ADXL375 CS\nGPIO5     2  PWM8         PWM2 B -> J6 row 10 (S8)\nGPIO6     3  IMU_INT1     ICM-45686 INT1\nGPIO7     4  IMU_CS       ICM-45686 AP_CS\nGPIO8     6  SENS_MISO    SPI1 RX\nGPIO9     7  (no connect) unexposed spare - no connect\nGPIO10    8  SENS_SCK     SPI1 SCK\nGPIO11    9  SENS_MOSI    SPI1 TX\nGPIO12   11  (no connect) unexposed spare - no connect\nGPIO13   12  BARO_INT     BMP581 INT\nGPIO14   13  BARO_CS      BMP581 CSB\nGPIO15   14  PWM7         PWM7 B -> J6 row 9 (S7)\nGPIO16   16  ELRS_RX      UART0 TX -> radio RX\nGPIO17   17  ELRS_TX      UART0 RX <- radio TX\nGPIO18   18  (no connect) unexposed spare - no connect\nGPIO19   19  PWM6         PWM1 B -> J6 row 8 (S6)\nGPIO20   20  PWM5         PWM2 A -> J6 row 7 (S5)\nGPIO21   21  (no connect) unexposed spare - no connect\nGPIO22   22  MAG_SDA      I2C1 SDA\nGPIO23   23  MAG_SCL      I2C1 SCL" (at 250 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5ab77c8a-8c8a-5163-9810-f6df3a801215))
(text "\nGPIO24   25  GPS_RX       UART1 TX -> GPS RX\nGPIO25   26  GPS_TX       UART1 RX <- GPS TX\nGPIO26   27  (no connect) unexposed spare - no connect\nGPIO27   28  (no connect) unexposed spare - no connect\nGPIO28   36  SD_D0        microSD DAT0 (PIO, GPIOBASE 16 window)\nGPIO29   37  SD_D1        microSD DAT1 (PIO, GPIOBASE 16 window)\nGPIO30   38  SD_D2        microSD DAT2 (PIO, GPIOBASE 16 window)\nGPIO31   39  SD_D3        microSD DAT3 (PIO, GPIOBASE 16 window)\nGPIO32   40  ESC_TELEM_RX ESC KISS telemetry in (PIO UART RX, window 16-47), 1k series R54\nGPIO33   42  SD_CLK       microSD CLK (PIO, GPIOBASE 16 window)\nGPIO34   43  SD_CMD       microSD CMD (PIO, GPIOBASE 16 window)\nGPIO35   44  SD_DET       microSD card detect\nGPIO36   45  PWM4         DShot via PIO (window 16-47)\nGPIO37   46  PWR_SRC_ST   U25 TPS2121 ST, open drain\nGPIO38   47  PWM3         DShot via PIO (window 16-47)\nGPIO39   48  PWM2         DShot via PIO (window 16-47)\nGPIO40   49  VBUS_SENSE   ADC0, USB_VBUS 10k/15k divider\nGPIO41   52  VBAT_SENSE   ADC1, VBAT 100k/10k divider, 36.3 V FS\nGPIO42   53  CURR_SENSE   ADC2, ESC current sense, 1k + 100n\nGPIO43   54  PWM1         DShot via PIO (window 16-47)\nGPIO44   55  IO_GPIO44    ADC4 -> J6 row 11 (A44)\nGPIO45   56  IO_GPIO45    ADC5 -> J6 row 12 (A45)\nGPIO46   57  IO_GPIO46    ADC6 -> J6 row 13 (A46)\nGPIO47   58  IO_GPIO47    ADC7 -> J6 row 14 (A47)" (at 338 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1ecf76d9-658f-5c44-ae84-05ab2d3eb074))
